{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type WithResult<TContext, TResult> = Prettify<Omit<TContext, \"result\" | \"hasResult\"> & Pick<TContext, \"baseSchema\" | \"schema\" | \"fromSourceName\"> & object>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts#L1359","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts:1359"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"WithResult - Updates a context with a new result type after select()"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This utility type is used internally when the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select()"},{"type":"text","value":" method is called\nto update the context with the projected result type. It preserves all\nother context properties while replacing the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"result"},{"type":"text","value":" field."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Usage"}]},{"type":"text","value":":\nWhen "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select()"},{"type":"text","value":" is called, the query builder uses this type to create\na new context where "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"result"},{"type":"text","value":" contains the shape of the selected fields."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The double "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Prettify"},{"type":"text","value":" ensures both the overall context and the nested\nresult type display cleanly in IDEs."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tcontext","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TContext"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TContext"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/Context.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Context"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tresult","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TResult"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TResult"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tcontext","text":"TContext","level":3},{"id":"tresult","text":"TResult","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype WithResult<TContext, TResult> = Prettify<Omit<TContext, \"result\" | \"hasResult\"> & Pick<TContext, \"baseSchema\" | \"schema\" | \"fromSourceName\"> & object>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts:1359](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts#L1359)\n\nWithResult - Updates a context with a new result type after select()\n\nThis utility type is used internally when the `select()` method is called\nto update the context with the projected result type. It preserves all\nother context properties while replacing the `result` field.\n\n**Usage**:\nWhen `select()` is called, the query builder uses this type to create\na new context where `result` contains the shape of the selected fields.\n\nThe double `Prettify` ensures both the overall context and the nested\nresult type display cleanly in IDEs.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TContext\n\n`TContext` *extends* [`Context`](../interfaces/Context.md)\n\n### TResult\n\n`TResult`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: WithResult\ntitle: WithResult\n---\n\n```ts\ntype WithResult<TContext, TResult> = Prettify<Omit<TContext, \"result\" | \"hasResult\"> & Pick<TContext, \"baseSchema\" | \"schema\" | \"fromSourceName\"> & object>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts:1359](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts#L1359)\n\nWithResult - Updates a context with a new result type after select()\n\nThis utility type is used internally when the `select()` method is called\nto update the context with the projected result type. It preserves all\nother context properties while replacing the `result` field.\n\n**Usage**:\nWhen `select()` is called, the query builder uses this type to create\na new context where `result` contains the shape of the selected fields.\n\nThe double `Prettify` ensures both the overall context and the nested\nresult type display cleanly in IDEs.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TContext\n\n`TContext` *extends* [`Context`](../interfaces/Context.md)\n\n### TResult\n\n`TResult`\n"}
